sequenceDiagram
    participant User as You or Claude Code hooks
    participant SG as suite-gate session
    participant GB as glassbox persist
    participant Agent as Agent session
    User->>SG: save (SessionStart with --hook)
    SG->>GB: snapshot of persistence points
    GB-->>SG: paths, categories, SHA-256 (no contents)
    User->>Agent: the session runs
    User->>SG: check (SessionEnd with --hook)
    SG->>GB: persist --audit-json --since the snapshot
    GB-->>SG: points added, changed, removed
    SG-->>User: report or audit result object
    SG-->>User: exit 1 if a point was added or changed, 2 if glassbox failed, else 0
